{"hymn":"SY85","parent":"NS10065","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"Cada día te amo más Señor","subtitle":"","syl":{"n2":["Ca","i"],"n3":["da","t"],"n4":["dí","i"],"n5":["a","t"],"n6":["te‿a","i"],"n7":["mo","t"],"n9":"más","n11":["Se","i"],"n12":["ñor,","t"],"n14":["Es","i"],"n15":["te","t"],"n16":["dí","i"],"n17":["a","t"],"n18":["te‿a","i"],"n19":["mo","t"],"n21":["mu","i"],"n23":["cho","t"],"n24":"más.","n26":"Ya","n27":"no","n28":["pue","i"],"n29":["do","t"],"n30":"yo","n31":["vi","i"],"n33":["vir","t"],"n35":"sin","n36":"Ti,","n38":"Ya","n39":"no","n40":["pue","i"],"n41":["do","t"],"n42":["co","i"],"n43":["mo‿an","m"],"n44":["tes","t"],"n47":["se","i"],"n48":["guir.","t"],"n50":"Oh,","n51":["e","i"],"n52":["sos","t"],"n53":["a","i"],"n54":["ños","t"],"n55":"que","n57":["pa","i"],"n59":["sé","t"],"n60":"sin","n62":"Ti,","n63":"Me","n64":["sal","i"],"n65":["vas","m"],"n66":["te","t"],"n67":"a","n69":["pun","i"],"n71":["to","t"],"n72":"de","n74":["mo","i"],"n75":["rir.","t"],"n76":["Cuan","i"],"n77":["do","t"],"n78":["ve","i"],"n79":["o‿el","t"],"n81":["pa","i"],"n83":["sa","m"],"n84":["do‿hay,","t"],"n86":["Lá","i"],"n87":["gri","m"],"n88":["mas,","t"],"n89":["do","i"],"n90":["lor","t"],"n91":"y","n92":["so","i"],"n95":["le","m"],"n96":["dad.","t"],"n98":["Ca","i"],"n99":["da","t"],"n100":["dí","i"],"n101":["a","t"],"n102":["te‿a","i"],"n104":["mo,‿a","m"],"n105":["ún","t"],"n106":["más‿Se","i"],"n107":["ñor;","t"],"n109":["Es","i"],"n110":["te","t"],"n111":["dí","i"],"n112":["a","t"],"n113":"yo","n114":["te‿a","i"],"n115":["mo,","t"],"n116":["mu","i"],"n117":["cho","t"],"n118":["más‿Se","i"],"n119":["ñor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"3.","lines":["Una inmensa sed dentro de mí,","Me llevó a buscar satisfacción.","Tantas cosas que he tratado yo,","Me han dejado seco e infeliz."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["En la búsqueda de algo más,","Siempre quise encontrarte a Ti.","Como un ciego, mil cosas probé,","Hasta que de Tu agua yo bebí."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Mi interior llenaste Tú, Señor,","Eres mi dulce satisfacción.","Como Espíritu eres todo en mí,","Y te mueves en mi espíritu."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["Gracias por entrar en mí, Señor;","Cada día te extiendes en mi","Haces Tu hogar en mi corazón,","Llenando cada parte de mí."]}]}